  "body": "I am using the webserial API to manage my headset settings over bluetooth RFCOMM/serial port profie,  On the Windows PC, it's working without any issue, but on the MacOSX PC, I can't open the port after granting the permission to it , I am using Electron to call the api, and from the console I can see there was an error `device_event_log_impl.cc(202)] [16:55:14.230] Bluetooth: bluetooth_serial_port_impl.cc:122 Failed to connect socket: address: 00:22:BB:7F:00:08, message: SDP query timeout` , is this api supported on Mac ?  I can confirm the headset is connected to the pc as the music streaming is ok ",
